#: core/templates/core/about.html:186
msgid ""
"We couldn't do this alone. These organisations help us with classroom space,"
" translation, and getting textbooks where they're needed."
msgstr "我们无法独自完成这件事。这些组织帮助我们提供教室空间、翻译以及将教科书送到需要的地方。"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:190
