#: core/templates/core/about.html:199
msgid "Want to be part of the next chapter?"
msgstr "想成为下一章的一部分吗？"

#: core/templates/core/about.html:200
msgid ""
"Whether you can teach an hour a week or just point us to someone who can — "
"we'd love to hear from you."
msgstr "无论您可以每周教一个小时，还是只是向我们推荐可以教课的人，我们都很乐意听取您的意见。"

